control: the home form: flagged (as the rule asks)
control: the absolute form: flagged (as the rule asks)
$HOME form: NOT flagged (MISSED)
${HOME} form: NOT flagged (MISSED)
file URL, three slashes: NOT flagged (MISSED)
path after a Markdown link bracket: flagged (as the rule asks)
path inside a shell assignment: flagged (as the rule asks)
path glued to a semicolon: NOT flagged (MISSED)
